<title>USA: Wall Street declines at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street declines at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials opened down on Thursday, tripped up by a slightly higher than expected rise in the core April consumer price index.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average was off 13.19 at 7,272.92 points but the Nasdaq Composite was up 0.94 at 1336.49.</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was off 14/32 to yield 6.92 percent.</p>
